OL,3,ATrump announces deal for Russian diesel
OL,4,Aas Zelensky criticises 'gift to Putin'
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn envoy to Putin welcomed the deal,
OL,7,Fbut Ukrainian President Volodymyr
OL,8,FZelensky said any easing of sanctions
OL,9,Fon Russia played into Moscow's hands
OL,10,Fand would prolong the war.
